{"version":1,"content":"<p>《GTA6》僅剩十天就發售了，這將是該系列十三年來的首款正統續作。雖然《給他愛5》和《GTA6》之間漫長的等待對於翹首以盼的粉絲來説有時感覺遙遙無期，但我們終於即將迎來這一刻。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585772.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.080567+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:13:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"5e16c1501babd3190ca05be970c84aa89b755819261464c9a471a0d4d40523cb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}